{"version":1,"key":"card:259","content":{"id":259,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd9c4956-d6b1-4f00-a9ef-265d5ae93605","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ES6 中通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"u"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标志为正则表达式提供了对 Unicode 的支持。不支持 Unicode 的例子："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"861067da-9e8a-42f1-b8d6-573d0c07bc52","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b69f6bd7-788d-4d6b-982c-2eb32b673a66","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 🤣 UTF-16 -> 0xd83e 0xdd23\nconst str = \"🤣\";\n\n// 1. 匹配任意一个字符\nconst reg1 = /^.$/;\nconsole.log(reg1.test(str));    // false\n\n// 2. 匹配 a b 🤣 中的随意一个字符\nconst reg2 = /^[ac🤣]$/;\nconsole.log(reg2.test(\"a\"));    // true\nconsole.log(reg2.test(\"c\"));    // true\nconsole.log(reg2.test(str));    // false\n\n// 3. 匹配两个 🤣\nconst reg3 = /🤣{2}/; \nconsole.log(reg3.test(\"🤣🤣\")); // false","collabId":"7614410b-d844-40a0-8bff-b29dab87bde8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83ca2106-a307-42ce-b98b-e666ed94407f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"出现上面的结果主要是正则表达式无法解码四字节表示的字符，会被认为是两个字符，即 🤣 会被认为是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\\ud83e"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\\udd23"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这两个字符。解释一下上面的结果："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"1d349a85-f73c-4b85-8b2f-a3248c626d67","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ab3f44c0-0bc4-4868-8cdd-5bb5b8afdf4a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4da0e379-0907-4181-8f5a-cf6d4b430a30","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/^.$/"},{"type":"formatted","text":"可以匹配任意一个字符，但是由于该正则不具备识别四字节字符的能力，🤣 被认为是两个字符，因此无法匹配"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1d6036c2-3e81-4875-8e28-5335dfcee14e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd857016-d7be-48b6-913d-a23644250856","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/^[ac🤣]$/"},{"type":"formatted","text":"可以匹配 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a b 🤣"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的随意一个字符，但因为无法识别 🤣，将其识别为两个字符，因此这个正则表达式等价于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/^[ac\\ud83e\\udd23]$/"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是 🤣 是两个字符，因此无法匹配"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c8efc6f2-0d7e-498d-941d-fc4858f21a70","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5f942279-769e-4cb6-90bf-7e58faffd7bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/🤣{2}/"},{"type":"formatted","text":"看似匹配两个 🤣，实际上我们将 🤣 进行分解，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/🤣{2}/.test(\"🤣🤣\")"},{"type":"formatted","text":"相当于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/\\ud83e\\udd23{2}/.test(\"\\ud83e\\udd23\\ud83e\\udd23\")"},{"type":"formatted","text":"就相当于是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"/ab{2}/.test(\"abab\")"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这是无法匹配的，如果我们将 🤣 包括括号，那么就可以匹配上"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"ad8769a2-3434-4dfc-90c0-226f87117057","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7e2ad8b2-9cb5-40b7-a4e5-0e09996b7a2b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(/(🤣){2}/.test(\"🤣🤣\")); // true","collabId":"6fdddbe4-bf00-4bfd-8a8a-0a1b25cc139c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e83f3789-32ad-4f80-9ae1-c15ecf817f92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在为正则表达式添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"u"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标志，那么就可以识别正则表达式和字符串中的四字节的字符"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"a7d537be-0b5e-43fc-b1a6-667569abe53b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"404157f9-7870-4e02-8a60-99e3e39a440b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 🤣 UTF-16 -> 0xd83e 0xdd23\nconst str = \"🤣\";\n\n// 1. 匹配任意一个字符\nconst reg1 = /^.$/u;\nconsole.log(reg1.test(str));    // true\n\n// 2. 匹配 a b 🤣 中的随意一个字符\nconst reg2 = /^[ac🤣]$/u;\nconsole.log(reg2.test(\"a\"));    // true\nconsole.log(reg2.test(\"c\"));    // true\nconsole.log(reg2.test(str));    // true\n\n// 3. 匹配两个 🤣\nconst reg3 = /🤣{2}/u; \nconsole.log(reg3.test(\"🤣🤣\")); // true","collabId":"dac44576-3f21-4764-b192-220605d33338","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1691234700804,"updateTime":1743303640422,"linkedCards":[{"id":257,"target":{"key":"card:257","type":"card","id":257},"summary":"JavaScript 字符串内部使用 UTF-16 存储，即用 16 位的码元来表示字符。对于码点超出 BMP（U+FFFF）的字符，需要两个码元表示，也就是代理对。但早期的一批字符串 API（如 length 、下标访问、 charAt ...","tags":["JavaScript/编码","JavaScript/字符串"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640422}}